\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf5 def\cf1  add_user(sn: Network, username: str, fullname: str) -> bool:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf3 """Add a user with no friends; return False for an existing username."""\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf5 try\cf1 :\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 if\cf1  username \cf5 in\cf1  sn:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             \cf5 return\cf1  \cf5 False\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         sn[username] = (fullname, [])\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 return\cf1  \cf5 True\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf5 except\cf1  (TypeError, ValueError) \cf5 as\cf1  error:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         print(f"Could not add the user: \{error\}")\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 raise\par
