\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf5 def\cf1  add_friend(sn: Network, user1: str, user2: str) -> bool:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf3 """Add a mutual link; reject missing users, self-links and existing links."""\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf5 try\cf1 :\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 if\cf1  user1 \cf5 not\cf1  \cf5 in\cf1  sn \cf5 or\cf1  user2 \cf5 not\cf1  \cf5 in\cf1  sn \cf5 or\cf1  user1 == user2:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             \cf5 return\cf1  \cf5 False\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 if\cf1  user2 \cf5 in\cf1  sn[user1][\cf4 1\cf1 ] \cf5 and\cf1  user1 \cf5 in\cf1  sn[user2][\cf4 1\cf1 ]:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             \cf5 return\cf1  \cf5 False\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 if\cf1  user2 \cf5 not\cf1  \cf5 in\cf1  sn[user1][\cf4 1\cf1 ]:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             sn[user1][\cf4 1\cf1 ].append(user2)\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 if\cf1  user1 \cf5 not\cf1  \cf5 in\cf1  sn[user2][\cf4 1\cf1 ]:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             sn[user2][\cf4 1\cf1 ].append(user1)\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 return\cf1  \cf5 True\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf5 except\cf1  (TypeError, KeyError, IndexError, AttributeError) \cf5 as\cf1  error:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         print(f"Could not add the friendship: \{error\}")\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 raise\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf5 def\cf1  get_friends(sn: Network, user1: str, distance: int) -> list[str]:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf3 """Return unique friends within distance links in breadth-first order."""\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf5 try\cf1 :\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 if\cf1  \cf5 not\cf1  isinstance(distance, int) \cf5 or\cf1  isinstance(distance, bool) \cf5 or\cf1  distance < \cf4 1\cf1 :\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             \cf5 raise\cf1  ValueError(\cf3 "Distance must be a positive integer."\cf1 )\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 if\cf1  user1 \cf5 not\cf1  \cf5 in\cf1  sn:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             \cf5 return\cf1  []\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         seen, frontier, result = \{user1\}, [user1], []\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 for\cf1  _ \cf5 in\cf1  range(distance):\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             following = []\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             \cf5 for\cf1  user \cf5 in\cf1  frontier:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1                 \cf5 for\cf1  friend \cf5 in\cf1  sn[user][\cf4 1\cf1 ]:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1                     \cf5 if\cf1  friend \cf5 not\cf1  \cf5 in\cf1  seen:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1                         seen.add(friend)\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1                         following.append(friend)\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1                         result.append(friend)\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             frontier = following\par
\page \pard\f0\fs28\b\sl360\slmult0\sa180 \cf1 Problem 3 Social network continued\par
\pard\f0\fs20\b0\sl260\slmult0\sa120 \cf1 p3_Alfaro_Jorge.py\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             \cf5 if\cf1  \cf5 not\cf1  frontier:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1                 \cf5 break\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 return\cf1  result\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf5 except\cf1  (TypeError, ValueError, KeyError, IndexError) \cf5 as\cf1  error:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         print(f"Could not find friends: \{error\}")\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 raise\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf5 def\cf1  save_network(filename: str, sn: Network) -> \cf5 None\cf1 :\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf3 """Save headerless CSV rows: username, full name, then each friend."""\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf5 try\cf1 :\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 with\cf1  open(filename, \cf3 "w"\cf1 , newline=\cf3 ""\cf1 , encoding=\cf3 "utf-8"\cf1 ) \cf5 as\cf1  file:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             writer = csv.writer(file)\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             \cf5 for\cf1  username, (fullname, friends) \cf5 in\cf1  sn.items():\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1                 writer.writerow([username, fullname, *friends])\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf5 except\cf1  (OSError, UnicodeError, csv.Error, TypeError, ValueError) \cf5 as\cf1  error:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         print(f"Could not save the network: \{error\}")\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 raise\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf5 def\cf1  load_network(filename: str) -> Network:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf3 """Read a network saved by save_network, rejecting malformed rows."""\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf5 try\cf1 :\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         network = \{\}\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 with\cf1  open(filename, newline=\cf3 ""\cf1 , encoding=\cf3 "utf-8"\cf1 ) \cf5 as\cf1  file:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1             \cf5 for\cf1  row \cf5 in\cf1  csv.reader(file):\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1                 \cf5 if\cf1  len(row) < \cf4 2\cf1  \cf5 or\cf1  row[\cf4 0\cf1 ] \cf5 in\cf1  network:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1                     \cf5 raise\cf1  ValueError(\cf3 "Missing fields or duplicate username."\cf1 )\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1                 network[row[\cf4 0\cf1 ]] = (row[\cf4 1\cf1 ], row[\cf4 2\cf1 :])\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 return\cf1  network\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1     \cf5 except\cf1  (OSError, UnicodeError, csv.Error, ValueError) \cf5 as\cf1  error:\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         print(f"Could not load the network: \{error\}")\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \cf1         \cf5 raise\par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \par
\pard\f1\fs17\b0\sl200\slmult0\sa0 \par
